DESCRIPTION:Analogue synth / sample-based • Salt Spring Island\n\nM o t 
 R (Mind of the Rabbit) is a long-time Salt Spring Island resident who has
  been hiding in the woods creating analogue synth and sample-based music 
 for many years. It has taken a long time to build the studio and collect 
 all the mystery boxes necessary to make the bits and beats.\n\nProfile: h
 ttps://thenectarfestival.com/products/m-o-t-r-mind-of-the-rabbit
