SUMMARY:Andromeda's Ocean
LOCATION:Arkhe Gallery
DESCRIPTION:Vocal / ethereal • Salt Spring Island\n\nAndromedas Ocean is
  an emerging Salt Spring artist\, writing and singing music for all starr
 y sirens and forest fae alike — music that comes from the depths of her
  heart and soul. Oceanic frequencies dancing upon raw emotional storytell
 ing\, the kind that comes from deep within love.\n\nProfile: https://then
 ectarfestival.com/products/andromedas-ocean
