SUMMARY:Delakit Presents Fairy Tea Party
LOCATION:Arkhe Gallery
DESCRIPTION:DJ / vocalist / spoken word\n\nDelakit (pronounced Delicate) i
 s an artist\, DJ\, and vocalist who brings intention and play to the danc
 efloor\, weaving spoken word\, storytelling\, and melodic soundscapes int
 o each set. As her name suggests\, Delakit thrives in times where etherea
 l sounds can be felt — sunset and sunrise\, when familiar faces are bat
 hed in golden light.\n\nProfile: https://thenectarfestival.com/products/d
 elakit
